remstart
    AVA, AND THE WAY DOWN TO HER
    the long visit (fish_headers_puzzle) is the last ending of the game. this is how a player gets to it, and what happens
    after they leave her. the routines are in fish_routines_ava, and the tests are in fish_tests_ava. the words are in
    build/make_ava_return.py.

    THE FIVE ENDINGS. the fish go home, the reef, the ancient one, the diver's album, and the god of the sea. each is
    remembered in the preferences already (PREF_ENDING_HOME and the rest), and avaEndingReached reads them, by the
    numbers of AVA_END_HOME and the rest.

    WELCOME BACK. the first time that she is asked anything after an ending has been reached, at the shop, from info mode,
    on the radio or with the card, she says two things about that ending before her questions (avaWelcome, in angler_run).
    it is said once for each ending, and the preferences keep which have been said (AVA_PREF_WELCOMED + the ending). the
    ancient one does not get a well done. she does not speak at the shop without being asked: see fish-angler-voice.

    THE SEA THAT IS LEFT. once an ending has been reached, her questions start with one of her own: "Is there more down
    here?" (AVA_PICK_SEA). she answers with a true hint at an ending that the player has not reached, and then that there is
    no need to go anywhere yet: she is the one being clingy. there is one hint for every ending that has been reached, so a
    new one opens with every ending, and none once there is nothing left to see (avaSeaDue). AVA_PREF_HINT + the ending keeps
    which have been heard. the hints go in the order of AVA_HINT_ORDER, the easy ones first.

    THE LAST QUESTION. with every ending reached, a new game goes down into the empty sea instead, and she comes up and asks
    (puzzle_offer): she has seen the lot, so the player will be going. there are three answers.
        staying    the long visit starts, from the first board, which begins "You stayed. I did tell you not to."
        leaving    she says goodbye, and she is gone (PUZZLE_GONE_PREF), and the game that was asked for starts
        one more   the game that was asked for starts, and the question goes into her list (AVA_PICK_LEAVE), where it waits.
                   staying from there means the next new game goes down to her. leaving there is the same goodbye, and she
                   leaves the shop with it. "not yet" keeps it waiting.
    AVA_PREF_OFFER keeps where that has got to: AVA_OFFER_NONE, AVA_OFFER_LATER, AVA_OFFER_INVITED, AVA_OFFER_TAKEN.

    SHE HAS GONE. before any goodbye she makes sure once (ava_sure): she will not come back up, and "No, wait" asks the
    question again. there is nobody at the shop (shopOpenAs), and the radio's HELP and INFO bring nobody. the card still comes
    with the seed, because a deal must never depend on what the player has done, but it says that it does nothing
    (ability.angler.gone), and taking it brings nobody. the lights that were kept go dark (anglerBankLoad): none show and
    none can be spent, and they are all still there if she comes back.

    THE WARM WATER. while the player is staying with her, and she has not gone, the sea of the main menu is lit warm from
    underneath, and it breathes (avaWarmStep, which frame_surface calls, and Warm in SurfaceEffect.fx). it is already there
    when the main menu comes back, and it only comes or goes over AVA_WARM_SECS# while the menu is up. FISH_MENU_WARM, or
    the "Ava: the way down" window, turns it on.

    THE BOTTLE. after AVA_BOTTLE_GAMES games without her (AVA_PREF_GONE_GAMES), a bottle floats on the water of the main menu
    (avaBottleStep, which frame_surface calls). the info key, or a click on it, reads the letter in it (ava_bottle_read): a
    few flat lines, one at a time, and FRIEND in Morse code. it stays there to be read again for as long as she is gone.

    FRIEND ON THE RADIO. FRIEND, tapped out in a game, brings her once the radio has tapped back its R (AVA_CALL_PENDING,
    which handle_angler looks at). while she is gone, she asks if the player is coming down (ava_return). coming down takes
    the game back to the main menu, and from there straight to the board that the player got to. "not now" leaves her gone,
    and it can be tapped again. while she is not gone, it is a call like HELP. it is not her name: the marks of AVA are
    inside the marks of INFO, and a word is heard whatever came before it, so INFO would bring her back halfway through.

    THE AVA WINDOW. with FISH_DEBUG, the "Ava" window (frame_debug_ava) sets every part of this, from the main menu or a game.
remend

global AVA_ENDING_COUNT = 5
global AVA_END_HOME = 1
global AVA_END_REEF = 2
global AVA_END_ANCIENT = 3
global AVA_END_DIVER = 4
global AVA_END_NEPTUNE = 5
global dim AVA_HINT_ORDER(5) `the order that the hints go in, from 0. setup_ava fills it.

` what is kept in the preferences. they are next to the ones of the long visit, which go up to PUZZLE_GONE_PREF.
global AVA_PREF_WELCOMED = 9010 `+ the ending: 1 once she has said that it was reached
global AVA_PREF_HINT = 9016 `+ the ending: 1 once she has given the hint at it
global AVA_PREF_OFFER = 9022 `where the last question has got to
global AVA_PREF_GONE_GAMES = 9023 `how many games have started since she went
global AVA_PREF_BOTTLE = 9024 `1 once the bottle has come
global AVA_PREF_BACK = 9025 `how many times FRIEND has brought her back
global AVA_PREF_FREED = 9026 `1 once she went at the end of the boards, and 2 once she has said how she is doing since
global AVA_OFFER_NONE = 0 `she has not asked
global AVA_OFFER_LATER = 1 `the player said "One more dive", so it is in her list
global AVA_OFFER_INVITED = 2 `the player said that they are staying, from her list, so the next new game goes down
global AVA_OFFER_TAKEN = 3 `the player went down to her
global AVA_OFFER_FREED = 4 `she went, at the end of the boards, to stay herself. the game is the usual one again. see avaFreed.

` the lines of her own at the top of the questions. ANGLER_PICK has these in place of a topic.
global AVA_PICK_SEA = -2
global AVA_PICK_LEAVE = -3
global AVA_PICKS = 0 `how many of the questions are hers, at the top

global AVA_BOTTLE_GAMES = 2
global AVA_BOTTLE_SPRITE = 0 `made the first time that it is needed, because the menu has to be there first
global AVA_BOTTLE_X# = 538 `where it floats: on the open water past the end of the boat, clear of its reflection, of the menu, and of the reefs, which an ending can put on the left and the right
global AVA_BOTTLE_DOWN = 52 `how far under the horizon
global AVA_BOTTLE_SIZE = 22
global AVA_BOTTLE_SUNK = 4 `how far under its middle the water comes up to
global AVA_BOTTLE_AT_X# = 0 `where it is on the screen, for a click
global AVA_BOTTLE_AT_Y# = 0
global AVA_BOTTLE_SEEN = 0 `1 while it is on the screen
global AVA_LETTER_TEXT_ID = 0
global AVA_LETTER_TALL = 24
global AVA_LETTER_WIDE = 440
global AVA_LETTER_FADE_MS = 400
global AVA_LETTER_LINES = 6

global AVA_WARM# = 0 `how warm the water of the main menu is now, from 0 to 1
global AVA_WARM_SECS# = 2.5 `how long it takes to come or go
global AVA_WARM_MS = 0 `when it was last stepped
global AVA_DBG_WARM = 0 `0 goes by the game, 1 always warm, 2 never
global AVA_SURE = 0 `1 when the player was sure about leaving. see ava_sure.
global AVA_TO_TITLE = 0 `1 when she has gone at the end of the boards, and the game goes back to the title. see THE END OF THE BOARDS in fish_headers_puzzle.

global MORSE_WORD_FRIEND = 17 `what she calls the player, and what her letter asks them to answer, after the words that call the old angler fish
global AVA_CALL_PENDING = 0 `1 when FRIEND has been tapped. she comes once the radio has answered.
global AVA_CALL_AT_MS = 0
global AVA_TO_DEEP = 0 `1 when the player said they are coming down, and the game has to go there

` THE AVA WINDOW
global AVA_DBG_ENDING = 1
global AVA_DBG_NAME$ = ""
global dim AVA_TEST_PREFS(72) `what fish_tests_ava makes the preferences say. a global dim in a test file is never made.
